      "options": {
        "content": "## Detail lives in the React dashboard\n\nGrafana covers aggregate honeypot health and attack **patterns**. Per-IP, per-path and per-credential detail is intentionally **not** stored as Prometheus labels (that would make cardinality explode), so it is served from PostgreSQL by the React dashboard.\n\n- React dashboard: http://localhost:3000\n- Geographic map view: React dashboard (GeoIP enrichment, not a Prometheus dimension)\n- Raw event drill-down: React dashboard, backed by Postgres\n\nPanels here stay cheap and stable to query, even under attack.",
        "mode": "markdown",
        "noValue": "no data yet"
      },
